==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Darkrai|105}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*{{a|Bad Dreams}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Darkrai}} can have.
*'''Dark Slumber''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Darkrai|3}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

